l_{\text {initial }}=0 \text { for } V_i \leq+1 \mathrm{~V}

This diode conduct only beyond $V_i=+1 \mathrm{~V}$
I_{\text {final }}=\frac{5}{250}=0.02 \mathrm{~A}

So, change in $I=0.02 \mathrm{~A}=20 \mathrm{~mA}$

Given : Voltage across the collector $\mathrm{V}_{0}=2\mathrm{V} ;$ collector resistance, $\mathrm{R}_{\mathrm{c}}=2 \times 10^{3} \Omega ;$ Base resistance $\mathrm{R}_{\mathrm{B}}=1 \times 10^{3} \Omega ;$ Input signal voltage, $\mathrm{V}_{\mathrm{i}}=?$

